title: "Closure–Residue P3 Lean Formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tagawa"
    given-names: "Katsuya"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Japan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-1844-4175"
abstract: >-
  Lean formalization of the finite-dimensional closure–residue core
  associated with the third paper of the Generative Map research program.
  The development formalizes observational closure, hidden sectors,
  quadratic return, residue formation, graph saturation, QDMR, and the
  Incidence Rank Theorem under the saturation hypothesis.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - operator algebras
  - quantum dynamics
  - non-Markovianity
  - closure-residue
  - graph incidence
  - QDMR
